{"speciesId":420,"names":{"fr":"Ceribou","es":"Cherubi","en":"Cherubi","ja":"チェリンボ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The small ball holds the nutrients needed for evolution. Apparently, it is very sweet and tasty."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Sunlight colors it red. When the small ball is drained of nutrients, it shrivels to herald evolution."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. STARLY try to peck it off."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It evolves by sucking the energy out of the small ball where it had been storing nutrients."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It evolves by sucking the energy out of the small ball where it had been storing nutrients."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Sa petite boule rose est nutritive et délicieuse. Les Étourmi en raffolent."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. Starly try to peck it off."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Sa petite boule rose est nutritive et délicieuse. Les Étourmi en raffolent."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. Starly try to peck it off."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. Starly try to peck it off."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. Starly try to peck it off."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il rougit au soleil. Quand la petite boule est à court de nutriments, elle fane en signe d’évolution."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Bajo la luz solar es rojo. La esfera pequeña pierde sus nutrientes y se seca para anunciar la evolución."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Sunlight colors it red. When the small ball is drained of nutrients, it shrivels to herald evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"日の光で 赤く 色づく。 栄養分が 吸われて 小さい 玉が しぼむと 進化が 近い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il aspire les nutriments de sa petite boule pour pouvoir évoluer."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Obtiene la energía necesaria para evolucionar de esa pequeña esfera que está cargada de nutrientes."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It evolves by sucking the energy out of the small ball where it had been storing nutrients."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"小さな 玉に つまった 栄養分を 吸い取って 進化の エネルギーに するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il rougit au soleil. Quand la petite boule est à court de nutriments, elle fane en signe d’évolution."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Bajo la luz solar es rojo. La esfera pequeña pierde sus nutrientes y se seca para anunciar la evolución."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sunlight colors it red. When the small ball is drained of nutrients, it shrivels to herald evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"日の光で 赤く 色づく。 栄養分が 吸われて 小さい 玉が しぼむと 進化が 近い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il aspire les nutriments de sa petite boule pour pouvoir évoluer."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Obtiene la energía necesaria para evolucionar de esa pequeña esfera que está cargada de nutrientes."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It evolves by sucking the energy out of the small ball where it had been storing nutrients."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"小さな 玉に つまった 栄養分を 吸い取って 進化の エネルギーに するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il s’enfuit à la vue des Pokémon oiseaux, dont le mets favori est sa petite boule remplie de nutriments."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se ve obligado a huir constantemente de los Pokémon pájaro, pues su pequeña esfera repleta de nutrientes es su manjar predilecto."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It nimbly dashes about to avoid getting pecked by bird Pokémon that would love to make off with its small, nutrient-rich storage ball."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"栄養の 詰まった 玉は 鳥ポケモンの 大好物。 ついばまれないよう 逃げまわる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Plus son corps est rouge, plus la saveur de sa petite boule gorgée de nutriments est sucrée et délicieuse."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuanto más rojo sea su cuerpo, más dulce y deliciosa será su pequeña esfera repleta de nutrientes."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The deeper a Cherubi’s red, the more nutrients it has stockpiled in its body. And the sweeter and tastier its small ball!"},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"体が 赤い チェリンボほど 栄養が 多く 玉の 味も 甘くて おいしいよ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Once the fruit growing alongside the main body is large and plump, Cherubi will use the nutrients within to evolve. The fruit then detaches, becoming nourishment for other creatures."}],"varieties":[{"id":420,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[24,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[8,"level-up",31],[9,"level-up",31],[10,"level-up",31],[11,"level-up",31],[14,"level-up",31],[15,"level-up",31],[16,"level-up",31],[17,"level-up",31],[18,"level-up",31],[20,"level-up",30],[23,"level-up",30]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[24,"level-up",37]]},{"name":"absorb","learns":[[24,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"leech-seed","learns":[[8,"level-up",10],[9,"level-up",10],[10,"level-up",10],[11,"level-up",10],[14,"level-up"